* $loinc-ontology-loinc#99476-4
// The rule itself: intensional include, expandable only on a terminology server that
// holds the LOINC Ontology release named by the alias
* include codes from system $sct-loinc-ontology where constraint = "<< 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : 370130000 |Property (attribute)| = (118569000 |Arbitrary concentration (property) (qualifier value)| OR 118539007 |Mass concentration (property) (qualifier value)| OR 118556004 |Substance concentration (property) (qualifier value)| OR 118550005 |Number concentration (property) (qualifier value)|), 246093002 |Component (attribute)| = (<< 312301006 |Infective organism antibody (substance)| OR << 116633006 |Microbial antigen (substance)|)"
